&lt;p&gt;In my head, I think I can 3D print the rest of the necessary components but I&apos;ll need to think a bit harder and get some advice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m going to explore a few more sites for costs and designs - Discord already been helping me out with links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;DiscordQuote username=&quot;karliss&quot;&amp;gt;
