&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://restfulapi.net/rest-api-testing/&quot;&gt;API Testing Best Practices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next Steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Try 2-3 tools from this list with your current API projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consider your team&apos;s collaboration needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate integration with your existing workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the switch gradually to minimize disruption&lt;/li&gt;
